# Module isolation

Edit only the directory you were assigned. Do not drive-by refactor other packages.

| Own | May read | Must not edit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `sdr/` | docs, configs | detect, aoa, host, `docs/interfaces.md` |
| `detect/` | docs, sdr types | aoa, host, interfaces fields |
| `aoa/` | docs, calib, configs | host, sdr, UHD |
| `host/` | docs (ZMQ) | aoa, sdr, MUSIC |
| `calib/` `geo/` `sim/` `tests/` `scripts/` | docs | other modules' sources |

Cross-module API is `docs/interfaces.md` only. If you need a new field, stop and ask the user; do not patch the markdown yourself.

```text
# BAD: aoa agent writes host/polar_widget.py
# GOOD: aoa agent only adds aoa/*.py consuming DetectionEvent
```
